# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CairoVolt — environment template (copy to .env.local; never commit secrets)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenAI (ChatGPT) Ads — Conversions API key.
# Server-only. Provision it in Ads Manager → Conversions tab (next to the Pixel).
# Production: stored in Secret Manager and bound in apphosting.yaml as
#   OPENAI_ADS_CAPI_KEY  ←  secret: openai_ads_capi_key
# Local:      paste into .env.local. Leave empty to disable server events
# (the browser pixel keeps working and orders are unaffected).
OPENAI_ADS_CAPI_KEY=

# The Pixel ID is public (it ships in the page) and lives in code:
#   src/lib/openai-ads/shared.ts → OPENAI_ADS_PIXEL_ID
